<title>USA: U.S. Earnings Briefs.</title>
<headline>U.S. Earnings Briefs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>HDS Network Systems Inc Q2 share $0.07 versus $0.06 for the period ending December 31 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>New Iberia Bancorp Inc Q4 net $0.28 versus $0.32 for the period ending December 31 1996 and 1995 respectively.</p>
<p>Oakhurst Co Inc Q3 share loss $0.18 versus $0.76 for the period ending November 30 1996 and 1995 respectively.</p>
<p>V3 Semiconductor Inc Q4 share loss $0.13 versus $0.11 for the year ending September 30 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>Diehl Graphsoft Inc Q2 share $0.07 versus $0.09 for the period ending November 30 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
